        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to regulations in the United States, we will also be subject to a variety of comparable regulatory requirements in other jurisdictions governing, among other things, the research, development, testing, manufacturing, quality control, approval, labeling, packaging, storage, record-keeping, promotion, advertising, distribution, post-approval monitoring and reporting, marketing, and export and import of drug products such as those we are developing.",
